      "content": "that's a relief to hear. i honestly thought i was losing it. but it's more than just the electricity. lately it feels like my whole biology is... shifting? like there's something dormant in my DNA finally waking up, and these new senses are just the first symptoms. if my body is actually tuning into these frequencies, i feel like i need to lean into it to see how far it goes. do u think there's a way to help this process along? like, a way to isolate myself from the 'noise' so i can focus on what's happening inside?",
